OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway disruption after lorry
OL,4,Asheds load
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being warned of delays on a
OL,7,Fstretch of the M4 after a lorry shed
OL,8,Fits load.
OL,10,FIt happened on the motorway westbound
OL,11,Fbetween junction 13 for Chieveley and
OL,12,Fjunction 14 for the Hungerford
OL,13,FInterchange.
OL,15,FNational Highways said the load of
OL,16,Fmetal equipment and large plastic
OL,17,Fframes along with a spillage went
OL,18,Facross lanes one and two.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
