OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway disruption after lorry
OL,4,Asheds load
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the debris had been cleared and
OL,7,Fa treatment applied to the damaged road
OL,8,Fsurface had proved successful, allowing
OL,9,Fall lanes to reopen. Drivers were being
OL,10,Fwarned to allow extra time for their
OL,11,Fjourneys while congestion clears.
